    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029570000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Alex. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029578266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return an item.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70733,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029582799999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029584666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF-881-62409.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70733,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029589866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... I see an order for one VeloBand Cadence Sensor, delivered on December 25th. That makes it 27 days ago. So I can process this correctly, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029591599998
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no issue. I just changed my mind.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70733,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029608466664
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. So it's just not getting much use?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029611399997
    },
    {
      "text": "It was an impulse buy. I don't use it, so I want to send it back. Simple as that.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70733,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029614333330
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. Let me just confirm the return policy for this item. Please hold for one moment.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029619933330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70733,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029626399996
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for waiting. Okay, I've checked the policy. Since your order was delivered within the last 10 days, it's still eligible for a full refund. I can go ahead and start that process for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029627099996
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh. Okay. So you're taking it back then?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70733,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029640299996
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. I've just emailed a pre-paid return shipping label to the address on file. You'll just need to box the item up, attach the label, and you can drop it off at any postal service location.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029643166662
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. I guess that saves me the trouble of having to find some resale website for it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 70733,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029656833328
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm glad I could make it easier for you. Once our warehouse receives the item, your refund will be issued to the original payment method. Is there anything else I can assist you with?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769029662966661
    },
    {
      "text": "No. That's it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
